  "decision_summary": "Pass: multiple high-transfer analogues sharing the styryl-benzoxazole, methylamino-aryl, and fluoroalkoxy motifs demonstrate robust BBB penetration in rodent PET/biodistribution and human PET studies. The only impermeable analogue is a polar nucleoside with negligible structural transfer, so the weight of evidence strongly supports meaningful CNS access for the query.",
